{"sourceUrl":"http://www.ib.cas.cn/2019gb/xialingying/","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:03.876665+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.ib.cas.cn/2019gb/xialingying/","html":"<div> <div><p><span>中国科学院植物研究所（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>植物所</span><span>”</span><span>）是历史悠久的综合性植物科学研究机构，为了增进优秀大学生对植物科学的认识和对植物所的了解，植物所将举办</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>“</span><span>探索植物科学</span><span>”</span><span>大学生夏令营，为广大优秀学子提供近距离接触植物科学的机会。</span></p><p><span>植物所夏令营分为</span><span>5</span><span>个主题：</span><span>“</span><span>植物分类与进化</span><span>”</span><span>、</span><span>“</span><span>生态学</span><span>”</span><span>、</span><span>“</span><span>植物分子奥妙</span><span>”</span><span>、</span><span>“</span><span>光生物学</span><span>”</span><span>、</span><span>“</span><span>资源植物</span><span>”</span><span>。同学们报名时应根据自身的专业学习情况及兴趣选择主题。</span><span> </span></p><p><strong><span>一、报名时间</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>即日起至</span></strong><strong><span>2026</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>28</span></strong><strong><span>日。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>二、活动时间</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2026</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span>7</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>-7</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>10</span></strong><strong><span>日（暂定）</span></strong><span>，如时间有变化，以最新通知为准。</span></p><p><strong><span>三、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>、申请人应为</span><span>“</span><span>双一流</span><span>”</span><span>高校相关专业在读三年级本科生（即</span><span>2027</span><span>届应届本科毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、学习成绩优秀，专业综合排名前</span><span>20%</span><span>，英语水平良好，课程无重修或补考记录，未受过纪律处分；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>、具有浓厚的科研兴趣，有较好的科研潜力，有志于从事科研事业。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、网上报名</span></strong></p><p><span>登陆中国科学院大学夏令营网上申报系统</span><span> http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn</span><span>，报名单位选择：</span><span>“</span><span>植物研究所</span><span>”</span><span>，填写报名信息，<strong>务必在备注栏中注明申请的夏令营主题</strong>。</span></p><p><strong><span>五、活动内容</span></strong></p><p><span>夏令营活动包括学术讲座、研究组介绍、科研平台展示、师生交流、科研实践等。</span></p><p><span>具体组织形式以最新通知为准。</span></p><p><strong><span>六、提交申请材料</span></strong></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日前，申请者将本人电子版申请材料按顺序制作成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文档（签字页须手签后扫描）发送至</span><span>zhaosheng@ibcas.ac.cn</span><span>。<strong>文件和邮件主题命名为</strong></span><strong><span>“</span></strong><strong><span>姓名</span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span>申请编号</span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span>本科高校名称</span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span>夏令营主题</span></strong><strong><span>”</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>、中国科学院大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年大学生夏令营申请表（报名网站下载并签字）；</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>、已修课程成绩单原件；</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>、英语四、六级成绩单复印件或体现自身英语水平的证明材料复印件；</span></p><p><span>4</span><span>、其它能佐证兴趣和能力的重要材料（已发表论文或出版物、奖励证书等）复印件。</span></p><p><span>七<strong>、入营通知</strong></span></p><p><span>入营名单将于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月初公布，并通过邮件通知入选者。未入选者，不另行通知。</span></p><p><span>欢迎全国大学生踊跃报名参加！</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>联系人：梁儒彪</span><span>  </span><span>许心</span><span>     </span></p><p><span>电</span><span>  </span><span>话：</span><span>010-62836619</span><span>、</span><span>62836601 </span></p><p><span>邮</span><span>  </span><span>箱：</span><span>zhaosheng@ibcas.ac.cn</span></p></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"4a609ce876367f32a72555b879ac4789d12c01730bc1f114f490e69f39c1a18e","textLength":869,"sourceSha256":"695f5d06e264e55ec19d65c07d21e38a31a84eb7387b2426c61efd7d924fe1cd","selector":".TRS_Editor","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b59c33b00587c5a6dfb7","title":"2025年中国科学院植物研究所2025年“探索植物科学”夏令营 报名","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:03.876665+00:00"}
